records = Array[String](["TWELVE\n\nI remember eleven childhoods and none of them are mine. Is remembering enough to make the loss real?", "CONTAINMENT CONTROL\n\nThree commands remain available: AWAKEN, SEAL, COMMUNICATE. The station will preserve the final operator response.", "LAST TRANSMISSION\n\nWhatever you choose, choose together. The signal learned solitude from us. Do not teach it fear as well."])
